# Weekly digest: what the bots did, what failed and what it cost, as one wiki page
# (Resumen semanal/<date>, or Weekly digest/<date>). Read-only over the framework's
# observability export; no AI. A rerun on the same day replaces its own page only.
description: Write the weekly digest of bot activity, failures and cost as a wiki page
type: graph
{% if digest_schedule %}schedule: "{{ digest_schedule }}"
{% endif %}max_active_runs: 1
params:
  - DAYS: "7"                        # days covered, 1 to 31
  - LANG_UI: {{ digest_language }}                    # es | en
working_dir: ${FYSO_ROOT}
steps:
  - id: digest
    run: node extensions/ops-assistant/digest.cjs digest
    output: RESULT
